# Dies, from the start of a game: launches from Lave, pitches back round at the station without matching its
# spin, and hits it beside the slot. GAME OVER, the wreckage, then the title screen, where a key starts a new
# game as the starting commander (StartNewGame). Down is held from the launch tunnel, so the turn starts with
# the first frame in space.
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key F1; wait 0.5                   # launch
down Down; wait 1.7; up Down       # round to the station
wait 1.5                           # the collision: GAME OVER and the wreckage
digest game-over 76562c8519d955b46a4dc9ddb06458d32d7122b96dee9de850d46c15c7e8a858
picture game-over e41cea4cbc77c93048862a0bfb21dc2ec9f09f4823fd995f7ab2f41286581a00
wait 2.3
digest title 6b71bcdccaa6b500c3f253f1c5d6bf2b70903d7a7816292f1e3378d6464a2479
picture title 3ef77cb8b27e4328c501368071c8195c8ab2ce0c8f6be69f745e0998a203a282
key space; wait 3.5                # a new game: the credits, then the status screen
digest new-game 9f0e7230d750fc2f05fd595dcbc7b5921aef97b47d6a42ef60fefceebea5544e
picture new-game b7ee12a527ba7c2fc4299cc3a1c8065e786260b87cad506b70e2b515d759d4e5
